<Dari title="示例数据概览">
<Notes>下面的数值是演示数据，用于体验稿件执行、图表和交付。</Notes>
<Pipeline>
// 为演示提供两行数据，并明确标记其性质。
let sample = data([{label:"A",value:2},{label:"B",value:3}],{kind:"example"});
let summary = jq("summary.jq",{sample});
debug(summary);
let chartSpec = {x:"label",value:"value",title:"示例数值"};
let tableSpec = {columns:["label","value"]};
</Pipeline>
<Asset language="jq" name="summary.jq">
{total:(.sample | map(.value) | add),rows:(.sample | length)}
</Asset>
<Template name="conclusion">
<article>
<p>示例共 <Value data={summary.rows} /> 行，合计 <Value data={summary.total} />。</p>
<figure><ColumnChart spec={chartSpec} data={sample} /><figcaption>示例数值</figcaption></figure>
<figure><Table spec={tableSpec} data={sample} /><figcaption>示例明细</figcaption></figure>
<p data-oks-shrink="">这些数值仅用于展示处理流程。</p>
</article>
</Template>
</Dari>
